+   /* Step 10 (vkQuake-arc W-3d): the WSI DIRECT path.  A headless-surface
+    * swapchain whose images are compositor PRESENTABLES: LINEAR venus images
+    * on MARKED dedicated allocations (no renderer bo -- the no-eager-mint
