+/* Block until the host-side vkAllocateMemory for `mem` is renderer-visible
+ * (WaitRingSeqno on the alloc's ring seqno).  Anything that names the memory
+ * host-side OUTSIDE the ring -- a renderer bo mint, a compositor presentable
+ * registration -- must order itself after the allocation through this
+ * (V-3b-3c-2b F7). */
